> It took three[ overt]imes, but No.[ 16-]ranked St. Thomas held off a[ hot]-shooting host Augsburg team Saturday in conference men's basketball play in Minneapolis. The Toms rode[ freshman] guard Anders Nelson['s hero]ics[ to] win[ 112]-105.
